# Both knobs swept fast and in opposite directions while a chord-like saw plays and the interval changes: P1 and P2
# move every block (the situation that crashed macro v3 on the device). Bounded and click-free.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 1
track fx1
input saw 165 0.6
preset 128 128 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 4
sweep p2 255 0 0 6
sweep p1 255 0 4 8
sweep p2 0 255 6 12
sweep p1 0 255 8 12
sweep p1 255 0 12 16
sweep p2 255 0 12 18
sweep p1 0 255 16 18
sweep p1 255 0 18 20
sweep p2 0 255 18 24
sweep p1 0 255 20 32
sweep p2 255 0 24 32
sweep p1 255 0 32 33
sweep p2 0 255 32 33
sweep p1 0 255 33 34
sweep p2 255 0 33 34
sweep p1 255 0 34 64
sweep p2 0 255 34 64
note 10 G3 1 100
note 20 C5 1 100
note 30 C2 1 100
note 40 C4 1 100
gain 1
expect sound 0 64
expect peak_below -0.5
